9/field-4/82f0679237d603c9b88d77fbc6f240065a24a3716631fab4d9f58426a7f011e5" :answer-field/choices ["q-343429/field-4/7b1b8538b264eef6681d0ab5f3b14d51b6cdff67f34fba59d0886ae5c6acf80a" "q-343429/field-4/6d0086fbf1d5dadda84b813260fdcf9f8964549bf3d2a02972d43bc272b01425" "q-343429/field-4/82f0679237d603c9b88d77fbc6f240065a24a3716631fab4d9f58426a7f011e5" "q-343429/field-4/b627bdd0369562afa8f12be8f167039ff5f7a2bdc550b832dce7f5205e0a89bc"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-343429" :question/id #uuid "b271ba23-5659-5776-8d73-e93697cc9383" :question/math-academy-id "q-343429" :question/problem "$$\nF(x)={\\begin{aligned}-1, & x\\in [-2,0] \\\\ 2, & x\\in (0,2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsider the function $F(x)$ shown above. The Fourier series of the $4$-periodic extension $f(x)$ of $F(x)$ is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{1}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{6}{\\pi (2n-1)}sin\\,(\\frac{(2n-1)\\pi x}{2}).\n$$\n\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below.At $x=1,$ we have\n\n$$\nsin\\,(\\frac{(2n-1)\\pi }{2})={{field-1}}.\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)$ is \n{{field-2}}\nat $x=1,$ the corresponding Fourier series converges to \n\n$$\nf(1)={{field-3}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have \n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}}{2n-1}={{field-4}}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite our Fourier series as\n\n$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{6}{\\pi }{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{2n-1}\\cdot sin\\,(\\frac{(2n-1)\\pi x}{2}).\n$$\n\nNow, notice that at $x=1,$ we have\n\n$$\nsin\\,(\\frac{(2n-1)\\pi }{2})=sin\\,(-\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi )=(-1)^{n+1}.\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)$ is $\\text{continuous}$ at $x=1,$ the corresponding Fourier series converges to \n\n$$\nf(1)=2.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(1) & =\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{6}{\\pi }{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{2n-1}\\cdot sin\\,(\\frac{(2n-1)\\pi \\cdot 1}{2}) \\\\ 2 & =\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{6}{\\pi }{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{2n-1}\\cdot (-1)^{n+1} \\\\ \\frac{3}{2} & =\\frac{6}{\\pi }{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}}{2n-1} \\\\ {\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}}{2n-1} & =\\frac{\\pi }{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-343429/field-1" "q-343429/field-2" "q-343429/field-3" "q-343429/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b3cb7656-1ce6-5b6a-9e88-5ba24a943c3f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-343429"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-343445/field-1/f059da041eb9c10af5c202e3f23518c1e88e6519cb516e4f5c2cc5a22f2b8121" :answer/id #uuid "5083f958-0db9-5279-8a6e-d73c85a7070d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-1)^{n}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343445/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "9920efb1-8fd4-5a8f-8036-afa53e8e4dae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343445/field-1/6176e2b047be2fa55f356f4eb746238d6c1d1572019aff3fe49b618179d289cd" :answer/id #uuid "5ec87b45-4b91-57d7-9ecb-dfeb036ecfe7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-1)^{n+1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343445/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "c449dae0-4098-596e-9db6-84de31e0d577" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343445/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "7b2b78a5-84c5-5a71-9ae5-c8465eaee88d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-343445/field-1/f059da041eb9c10af5c202e3f23518c1e88e6519cb516e4f5c2cc5a22f2b8121" :answer-field/choices ["q-343445/field-1/f059da041eb9c10af5c202e3f23518c1e88e6519cb516e4f5c2cc5a22f2b8121" "q-343445/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-343445/field-1/6176e2b047be2fa55f356f4eb746238d6c1d1572019aff3fe49b618179d289cd" "q-343445/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e